<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="es"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Nexo | Historias</title><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css"></head>
<body class="page-posts"><%- include('partials/ambient') %><%- include('partials/header', { activePage: 'posts' }) %><main class="feed-shell"><section class="feed-hero reveal"><div><div class="signal"><i></i><span>EXPLORA LO NUEVO</span><b><%= String(posts.length).padStart(2,'0') %> HISTORIAS</b></div><h1>Voces que crean<br><em>nuevas realidades.</em></h1></div><p>Una colección viva de ideas, experiencias y perspectivas de nuestra comunidad.</p></section>
<% const messages={created:'Historia publicada correctamente.',updated:'Cambios guardados correctamente.',deleted:'Historia eliminada correctamente.'}; %><% if(messages[notice]){ %><div class="toast reveal" role="status"><i>✓</i><span><strong>Todo listo</strong><%= messages[notice] %></span></div><% } %>
<section class="feed-toolbar reveal"><div class="filter-pills"><span class="active">Todas</span><span>Recientes</span><span>Destacadas</span></div><a class="btn btn-glow magnetic" href="/posts/new"><span>Nueva historia</span><b>＋</b></a></section>
<% if(!posts.length){ %><section class="empty-state reveal"><div class="empty-orbit"><span>✦</span></div><p>ESPACIO DISPONIBLE</p><h2>La primera historia<br>puede ser la tuya.</h2><a class="btn btn-glow" href="/posts/new">Comenzar ahora <b>→</b></a></section><% }else{ %>
<section class="story-grid"><% posts.forEach((post,index)=>{ %><article class="feed-card tilt-card reveal" data-tilt style="--delay:<%= index * 80 %>ms"><div class="feed-media <%= post.imageUrl ? 'has-image' : '' %>"><% if(post.imageUrl){ %><img src="<%= post.imageUrl %>" alt="Imagen de <%= post.title %>"><% }else{ %><div class="generated-art"><span><%= String(index+1).padStart(2,'0') %></span><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><% } %><div class="card-index"><%= String(index+1).padStart(2,'0') %></div><div class="card-actions"><a href="/posts/<%= post._id %>/edit" aria-label="Editar <%= post.title %>">EDITAR <b>↗</b></a><form method="POST" action="/posts/<%= post._id %>/delete" onsubmit="return confirm('¿Eliminar esta publicación?');"><button type="submit" aria-label="Eliminar <%= post.title %>">×</button></form></div></div>
<div class="feed-content"><div class="author-line"><i><%= post.user?.name?.charAt(0)||'N' %></i><p><strong><%= post.user ? post.user.name+' '+(post.user.lastName||'') : 'Usuario' %></strong><small><%= new Intl.DateTimeFormat('es-PE',{day:'2-digit',month:'short',year:'numeric'}).format(new Date(post.createdAt)) %></small></p></div><h2><%= post.title %></h2><p class="excerpt"><%= post.content %></p><div class="card-foot"><div class="tags"><% (post.hashtags||[]).slice(0,3).forEach(tag=>{ %><span>#<%= tag.replace('#','') %></span><% }) %></div><span class="read-mark">NEXO ↗</span></div></div><div class="shine"></div></article><% }) %></section><% } %></main><%- include('partials/footer') %></body></html>
